{"title": "Lisandro Martinez Apologizes for Criticism of Manchester United Leadership", "summary": "Argentina defender Lisandro Martinez has apologized for his post-match comments criticizing Manchester United's leadership and transfer dealings. The apology followed meetings with club chiefs, including Michael Carrick. Martinez had reportedly expressed disappointment with the team's performance and expectations from 'upstairs' after a 2-0 defeat to Atletico Madrid. His initial remarks were described as 'awful' and 'disrespectful' by former players like Jamie Carragher and Wayne Rooney, prompting Martinez to issue a fresh statement and apology.", "summary_points": [], "title_hi": "ल Lisandro Martinez ने मैनचेस्टर यूनाइटेड नेतृत्व की आलोचना के लिए माफी मांगी", "summary_hi": "अर्जेंटीना के डिफेंडर Lisandro Martinez ने मैनचेस्टर यूनाइटेड के नेतृत्व और ट्रांसफर सौदों की आलोचना करने वाली अपनी पोस्ट-मैच टिप्पणियों के लिए माफी मांगी है। यह माफी क्लब के अधिकारियों, जिसमें Michael Carrick भी शामिल थे, के साथ हुई बैठकों के बाद आई। Martinez ने कथित तौर पर Atletico Madrid से 2-0 की हार के बाद टीम के प्रदर्शन और 'ऊपर से' की उम्मीदों पर निराशा व्यक्त की थी। उनकी शुरुआती टिप्पणियों को Jamie Carragher और Wayne Rooney जैसे पूर्व खिलाड़ियों ने 'भयानक' और 'अपमानजनक' बताया था, जिसके बाद Martinez ने एक नया बयान और माफी जारी की।", "summary_points_hi": [], "framing": {"left": ["Emphasizes Martinez's apology following meetings with Michael Carrick and club chiefs.", "Highlights the criticism from former players like Jamie Carragher and Wayne Rooney, who called the remarks 'awful' and 'disrespectful'."], "center": ["Focuses on Martinez's apology for his 'rant' after talks with Carrick and club leadership.", "Mentions Martinez's expectation of more from 'upstairs' after the 2-0 defeat to Atletico Madrid."], "right": ["Reports Martinez's apology for his post-match outburst after meeting with Man Utd leadership."]}, "framing_hi": {"left": ["Michael Carrick और क्लब के अधिकारियों के साथ बैठकों के